# Marks the cave_dossier workspace root: the directory holding config.yaml,
# .env, data/, runs/ and sb-sync/.
#
# cave_dossier.core.paths.workspace_root() walks up for this file, which is
# why the same rule works in a dev clone and in an extracted prod bundle at
# %LOCALAPPDATA%\CaveDossier\v<X>. prod/build_prod.py ships it in bundle.zip;
# without it, every operator run fails at startup.
